      "proposed_content": "The parents jointly establish a rigorous local close-pair regime and a separate empirical second-bump phenomenon, but they do not establish the candidate's attribution of the full-distribution shape to other root configurations. What is supported is only a boundary of explanation: the small-gap theorem does not explain the observed global bimodality, whose cause the source leaves open.",
